#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit SDK from source {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-source}"
msgstr ""
"I-install ang Qiskit SDK mula sa source {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-"
"source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you install the Qiskit SDK from source, you can access the current "
"development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package "
"Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest "
"version of the Qiskit code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nag-install ka ng Qiskit SDK mula sa source, maaari kang ma-access ang"
" kasalukuyang development version, sa halip na gamitin ang bersyon sa Python"
" Package Index (PyPI) repository. Kaya naman, mas mahusay mong masusuri at "
"mapapalawak ang pinakabagong bersyon ng Qiskit code.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Gumawa at mag-activate ng bagong virtual environment {#create-and-activate-"
"a-new-virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with "
"only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa iyong project directory at gumawa ng minimal na environment na "
"may Python lamang na naka-install dito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang iyong bagong environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Rust compiler {#install-the-rust-compiler}"
msgstr "I-install ang Rust compiler {#install-the-rust-compiler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Rust compiler must be installed on your system to compile Qiskit. To "
"install the Rust compiler, use the cross-platform Rust installer "
"[`rustup`](https://rustup.rs/) or [another install "
"method](https://forge.rust-lang.org/infra/other-installation-"
"methods.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kailangan ng Rust compiler na naka-install sa iyong system para ma-compile "
"ang Qiskit. Para i-install ang Rust compiler, gamitin ang cross-platform "
"Rust installer na [`rustup`](https://rustup.rs/) o [ibang paraan ng pag-"
"install](https://forge.rust-lang.org/infra/other-installation-"
"methods.html).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"
msgstr "I-install ang Qiskit {#install-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit:\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para i-install ang Qiskit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit repository.\n"
msgstr "I-clone ang Qiskit repository.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit` directory.\n"
msgstr "Lumipat sa `qiskit` directory.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Opsyonal) Kung gusto mong magpatakbo ng mga test o linting check, i-install"
" ang mga developer requirement.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit`.\n"
msgstr "I-install ang `qiskit`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Standard install**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Editable mode**: Sa mode na ito, hindi mo na kailangang mag-reinstall ng "
"Qiskit kapag may mga pagbabago sa code ng project.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations. This affects the runtime performance of the compiled "
"code. To build the compiled extensions with optimizations enabled, run the "
"following command to rebuild the binary in _release mode_:\n"
msgstr ""
"    Sa editable mode, ang mga compiled extension ay nibo-build sa _debug "
"mode_ nang walang mga optimization. Nakakaapekto ito sa runtime performance "
"ng compiled code. Para ma-build ang mga compiled extension na may mga naka-"
"enable na optimization, patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command para ma-rebuild "
"ang binary sa _release mode_:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    python setup.py build_rust --release --inplace\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    python setup.py build_rust --release --inplace\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    If you are working on Rust code in Qiskit, you need to rebuild the extension code every time you make a local change. In editable mode, the Rust extension is only built when the install command is run, so local changes you make to the Rust code are not reflected in the installed package unless you rebuild the extension by rerunning `build_rust` (with or without `--release`, depending on whether you want to build in release or debug mode).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"    Kung nagtatrabaho ka sa Rust code sa Qiskit, kailangan mong i-rebuild ang extension code sa tuwing gagawa ka ng lokal na pagbabago. Sa editable mode, ang Rust extension ay nibo-build lamang kapag pinatakbo ang install command, kaya ang mga lokal na pagbabago na ginagawa mo sa Rust code ay hindi makikita sa installed package maliban kung i-rebuild mo ang extension sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ulit ng `build_rust` (na may o walang `--release`, depende kung gusto mong mag-build sa release o debug mode).\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to the open-source Qiskit SDK.\n"
"  - [Run your first quantum circuit](/guides/quick-start).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  - Basahin ang [mga alituntunin sa pag-aambag](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) para makapag-ambag sa open-source Qiskit SDK.\n"
"  - [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang quantum circuit](/guides/quick-start).\n"
"  - Subukan ang isang tutorial, tulad ng [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
